---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import StatusBadge from '../../components/StatusBadge.astro';

const pipelineDiagram = `
flowchart TD
    FileGenerated[Generated File Draft] --> SyntaxCheck{AST Syntax Check}
    SyntaxCheck -- Pass --> ImportCheck{Import Resolution}
    SyntaxCheck -- Fail --> Repair[Auto-Repair Loop]
    ImportCheck -- Pass --> SecurityCheck{Security Audit}
    ImportCheck -- Fail --> Repair
    Repair --> RetryCheck{Retry < 2?}
    RetryCheck -- Yes --> SyntaxCheck
    RetryCheck -- No --> Restore[Restore Clean Backup]
    SecurityCheck -- Pass --> Certified[Certified & Committed]
`;

const auditDiagram = `
graph LR
    ModelCall[LLM Model Call] --> LogStream[Engineering Event Recorder]
    DebateStep[Debate Decision] --> LogStream
    GateCheck[Certification Check Result] --> LogStream
    LogStream --> JSONL[Tamper-Evident JSONL File]
`;
---

<Base
  title="Build, Review & Recovery Workflows — StructZero Docs"
  description="Operational documentation for pre-flight verification, automated repair loops, and immutable audit logs in StructZero."
>
  <section class="py-16 border-b border-[#1e1e1e] bg-[#0a0a0a]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#7c7d80] mb-4">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#4d8fe0]">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <a href="/docs/" class="hover:text-[#4d8fe0]">Docs</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-[#e9e9ea]">Workflows</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#e9e9ea]">Workflows & Verification</h1>
        <StatusBadge status="Available" size="md" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#96979a] max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        Understand the pre-flight verification pipeline, automated localized repair loops, and audit recovery mechanisms that prevent broken code from shipping.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-16 bg-[#000000]">
    <!-- Anchored Section: #verification -->
    <div id="verification" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#1e1e1e] pb-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#e9e9ea]">Automated Pre-Flight Verification Gate</h2>
        <StatusBadge status="Available" size="sm" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#96979a] leading-relaxed">
        Code generation does not conclude when the model finishes emitting text. Every proposed file passes through an automated pre-flight quality pipeline before it is committed to disk.
      </p>

      <!-- Mermaid Diagram of Pipeline -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#1e1e1e] bg-[#111111]">
        <pre class="mermaid">{pipelineDiagram}</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#1e1e1e] bg-[#111111]">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#e9e9ea] mb-2">1. AST Syntax Compilation</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#96979a] leading-relaxed">
            Parses generated code using real compiler APIs (TypeScript compiler, Python AST module). If a syntax error is discovered, the code is flagged immediately.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#1e1e1e] bg-[#111111]">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#e9e9ea] mb-2">2. Import Path Resolution</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#96979a] leading-relaxed">
            Verifies that every imported module file exists on disk and that named exports match the actual symbol table of the target module.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#1e1e1e] bg-[#111111]">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#e9e9ea] mb-2">3. Auto-Repair Loops</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#96979a] leading-relaxed">
            When verification detects an isolated defect, a repair agent makes an automated fix attempt (capped at two iterations) to resolve the error.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#1e1e1e] bg-[#111111]">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#e9e9ea] mb-2">4. Clean State Restoration</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#96979a] leading-relaxed">
            If repair attempts fail, StructZero restores the verified clean backup. Your workspace is never left in an uncompilable state.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Anchored Section: #audit-and-recovery -->
    <div id="audit-and-recovery" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-6 border-t border-[#1e1e1e] pt-12">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#1e1e1e] pb-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#e9e9ea]">Engineering Event Recorder & Audit Recovery</h2>
        <StatusBadge status="Available" size="sm" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#96979a] leading-relaxed">
        Every prompt, model debate step, AST validation check, and operator approval is written to append-only JSONL event logs. This provides complete auditability and enables deterministic replay.
      </p>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#1e1e1e] bg-[#111111] space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#e9e9ea]">Event Logging Architecture</h3>
        <pre class="mermaid">{auditDiagram}</pre>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#96979a] leading-relaxed">
          Logs are saved locally under <code class="text-[#e9e9ea] bg-[#000000] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#1e1e1e]">.system_generated/logs/</code> and can be exported for enterprise SIEM ingestion or compliance auditing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
